; Run from the versioned NIO: share:
;   Execute NIO:Install-FujiNet-WB13
;
; This installs the WB1.3/nix13 FujiNet artifacts.  FMOUNT chooses the
; appropriate DD/HD and OFS/FFS static endpoint after inspecting each ADF.
; It is safe to run again; the MountList block is written only on the first
; successful installation.

; Always refresh the operational tools, including when upgrading an existing
; installation.  Only MountList installation must remain one-time.
Copy NIO:fujinet-nio.device TO DEVS:
Copy NIO:fujinet-disk.device TO DEVS:
Copy NIO:fujinet-load-resident TO C:
Copy NIO:fujinet-mount TO C:
Copy NIO:fujinet-nio-exchange TO C:
Copy NIO:fapp TO C:
Copy NIO:fboot TO C:
Copy NIO:fdrive TO C:
Copy NIO:fhost TO C:
Copy NIO:fin TO C:
Copy NIO:fls TO C:
Copy NIO:fmount TO C:
Copy NIO:fumount TO C:
Copy NIO:fout TO C:

If EXISTS S:FujiNet-WB13-Static-Installed
  Echo "FujiNet WB1.3 files refreshed; automatic static MountList retained."
Else
  If EXISTS S:FujiNet-WB13-Installed
    Echo "Legacy FujiNet WB1.3 MountList detected. Restore a clean DEVS:MountList"
    Echo "before installing the automatic DD/HD and OFS/FFS configuration."
  Else
    ; WB1.3 Mount only reads the shared list. Keep the existing entries that
    ; provide NEWCON:, AUX:, PIPE:, etc., and append initially-inactive
    ; DN/HN/DO/HO entries. FMOUNT starts exactly one matching handler per unit.
    Copy DEVS:MountList TO RAM:MountList-Existing
    Join RAM:MountList-Existing NIO:MountList-FujiNet-WB13 AS DEVS:MountList
    Delete >NIL: RAM:MountList-Existing

    Echo >S:FujiNet-WB13-Static-Installed "Installed automatic FujiNet WB1.3 MountList"
    Echo "Installed. Add these lines before Break 1 C in S:StartupII:"
    Echo "C:fujinet-load-resident DEVS:fujinet-nio.device fujinet-nio.device"
    Echo "C:fujinet-load-resident DEVS:fujinet-disk.device fujinet-disk.device"
    Echo "Do not add C:Mount lines: FMOUNT starts the matching handler."
    Echo "Then, after the next boot: FMOUNT 11 0 RO"
    Echo "It reports DN0:/HN0:/DO0:/HO0: after inspecting the image."
    Echo "To eject it: FUMOUNT 0"
    Echo "To mount again after ejecting: FMOUNT 11 0 RO"
  EndIf
EndIf
